---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ProjectCTA from '../components/ProjectCTA.astro';
import { steps, faqs } from '../lib/business';
export const prerender = true;
---
<Layout title="How We Work | Zulo" description="How a Zulo program runs: understand the operation, prove the first workstream, ship it into the business, and extend it with your team." nav="approach">
  <main id="main-content" class="transformation-page">
    <section class="page-masthead site-container">
      <p class="section-kicker">HOW WE WORK</p>
      <h1>Start focused.<br />Extend what proves out.</h1>
      <p class="page-lead">How a program runs: a diagnostic that ranks the opportunities, a first workstream that proves the case, and delivery that extends from there.</p>
    </section>
        <section id="approach" class="section-pad site-container">
            <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="section-kicker">THE PROCESS</p><h2>Each step earns<br />the next one.</h2></div><p>Transformation is a sequence of useful changes. Each step produces something concrete and tells us what deserves to happen next, so the program grows on evidence.</p></div>
            <ol class="steps">{steps.map((step, index) => <li><span class="step-number">0{index + 1}<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span><h3>{step.title}</h3><p>{step.text}</p><div class="step-output">{step.output}</div></li>)}</ol>
            <div class="approach-note"><span aria-hidden="true">◎</span><p><strong>People stay in the loop.</strong> Clear ownership, deliberate review points, and usable interfaces are part of the system from the start.</p></div>
        </section>

        <section class="site-container faq-section section-pad"><div><p class="section-kicker">A FEW GOOD QUESTIONS</p><h2>Before we<br />get started.</h2><a class="text-action light-link" href="/contact">Talk it through <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="faq-list">{faqs.map(faq => <details><summary>{faq.question}<span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><p>{faq.answer}</p></details>)}</div></section>
    <ProjectCTA />
  </main>
</Layout>
